The Crystal-Field Hamiltonian:
   Hcf = SUM_{k,q} * [ B(k,q) * O(k,q) + C(k,q) * W(k,q) ];
where:
   O(k,q) =  0.5 * ( (-1)**q * Y(k,+q) + Y(k,-q) );
   W(k,q) = -0.5 * ( (-1)**q * Y(k,+q) - Y(k,-q) ) * I;   (I = imaginary unit)
   k - the rank of the ITO, = 2, 4, 6;
   q - the component of the ITO, = 0, 1, 2, ... k;
These operators have been defined in: 
  L. F. Chibotaru, L.Ungur, J. Chem. Phys., 137, 064112 (2012).
