The Crystal-Field Hamiltonian:

   Hcf = SUM_{k,q} * [ B(k,q) * O(k,q) ];

 where:                                  
   O(k,q) =  Irreducible Tensor Operators
             defined as follows:         

          Y(k,q)             CG(J,M2,k,q,J,M1)
 < J,M1 | ------ | J,M2 >  = -----------------
          Y(k,0)              CG(J,J,k,0,J,J) 

  CG - Clebsh-Gordan Coefficient:
                            c,gm     
      CG(a,al,b,bt,c,gm) = C         
                            a,al,b,bt

